# D3-PO-010: A thermoplastic article and its repeat-unit stock are not identical objects
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 thermoplastic 2g @ 20C
add v2 PE 2g @ 20C
heat v1 0.5kJ
heat v2 0.5kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
look v1
look v2
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
